    "text": "A battery energy storage system (BESS) for powering an alkaline or PEM hydrogen production system. The BESS is charged by power from the grid during oversupply when the prices are low or negative; and discharged, thereby powering the hydrogen production system during peak demand. The BESS may have a lithium ion phosphate or lithium-titanate battery in between the system. Alternatively, another storage system may be used. Alternatively, other storage systems may be used.",
